1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,392
Stop scrolling!

2
00:00:01,442 --> 00:00:04,085
Born in the Year of the Dog?

3
00:00:04,135 --> 00:00:06,681
Your luck isn't good today.

4
00:00:06,731 --> 00:00:09,950
But don't worry, watch to the end.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,384
Today, 2 November, is a Dragon day

6
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:17,223
